{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"熊本県をはじめとする九州地方で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"連日強い地震が続いています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"被災された方の気持ちを考えると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸が痛みます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前の日常が突然失われ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"錯乱する情報、未経験の数々、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変化し続ける状況に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"立ち向かわなければならないことが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれほどの心労を要するか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日でも早く、被災された皆様のもとに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日常が戻りますよう、祈っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、先日の握手会会場では"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の地震に対する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"募金箱を設置しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場にお越しくださった多くの方々に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご協力頂き、感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"引き続き、微力ではありますが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グループとしても個人としても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来ることを考え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行動していきたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山﨑怜奈"}],"source":"archive"}